<title>NEW ZEALAND: Wilson and Horton to pay int div earlier.</title>
<headline>Wilson and Horton to pay int div earlier.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wilson and Horton Ltd said on Thursday its interim dividend of NZ$0.15/share, announced on August 22, was now payable on October 7 rather than October 25 as previously announced.</p>
</text>
